49:17.860 --> 49:23.000
if we don't build the tacit knowledge, the sticky information of how to handle the intermediate steps,

49:23.200 --> 49:27.140
how the raw materials behave when they get too hot, how to troubleshoot the synthesis,

49:27.140 --> 49:32.400
aren't we putting our future civilization in the exact position of the Roman concrete builders?

49:32.680 --> 49:34.040
That is a chilling implication.

49:34.560 --> 49:38.820
We might possess the ultimate magic recipes, perfectly legible on our servers.

49:39.260 --> 49:45.020
